WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.760
Quick Add opens your camera. Set up first, then shoot.

00:00:05.060 --> 00:00:07.519
Choose the type of collectible you're adding.

00:00:09.319 --> 00:00:12.277
Choose a category if you want to narrow it further.

00:00:14.077 --> 00:00:18.795
Tap here to photograph your item. Repeat for each additional item.

00:00:21.095 --> 00:00:25.089
When you're done taking photos, select Finished to review them.

00:00:25.389 --> 00:00:28.896
Here you can check your photos, and the choices you made.
